Maintainer: William Daugherty <31995458+billsecond@users.noreply.github.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/billsecond/patrone-linux.git

Package: patrone-shell-config
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, zsh, zsh-syntax-highlighting, zsh-autosuggestions
Description: zsh setup for Patrone Linux users
 Installs Patrone's .zshrc and .zprofile in /etc/skel and makes zsh the
 login shell of users created after installation. The prompt takes two
 lines, blue for normal users and red for root, with syntax highlighting and
 suggestions from history.
